        "text": "Dragon Form Bonus: The fireball is wider, can pass through enemies, and deals 25% increased damage. Upon hitting an enemy champion or large monster, and after reaching maximum range, the fireball sets an explosion upon the targets struck and at the location that applies the same effects. Molten Burst will also scorch the ground it touches beneath for 2 seconds. Enemies within a scorched field are dealt 3.75 / 5 / 6.25 (based on level) (+ 1.25% AP) magic damage every 0.25 seconds, for a total maximum damage of 30 / 40 / 50 (based on level) (+ 10% AP).\n\nEnemies may be damaged by only one scorched field at a time. Subsequent explosions against the same target deal 40% damage.",
